<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>very easy way to execute OTGF on Heihachi, I recommend you to put this macro (for the keyboard) next to the E button like R

Key mapping ;
W = UP
A = BACK
S = DUCK
D = FORWARD

NUM4 = 1
NUM8 = 2
NUM6 = 3
NUM5 = 4</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 7 1
Delay 17 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyDown 22 1
Delay 17 ms
KeyDown 7 1
KeyDown 24 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 24 1
Delay 64
Delay 17 ms
KeyUp 22 1
Delay 17 ms
KeyDown 24 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 24 1
Delay 64
Delay 17 ms
KeyUp 7 1
Delay 300 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tekken 8</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>